"use strict";(self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_marketplace=self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_marketplace||[]).push([[442],{2979(a,e,t){t.r(e),t.d(e,{comp:()=>l,data:()=>d});var n=t(641);const s=t.p+"assets/img/vendors-payout-management.33ad9692.webp",i=t.p+"assets/img/vendor-payout-filter.ec86c20a.webp",o=t.p+"assets/img/vendor-payout-bulk-actions.a25765b5.webp",r={},l=(0,t(6262).A)(r,[["render",function(a,e){return(0,n.uX)(),(0,n.CE)("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[(0,n.Fv)('<h1 id="vendors-payout-management" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#vendors-payout-management"><span>Vendors Payout Management</span></a></h1><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/vendors-payout-management.webp"><img src="'+s+'" alt="Vendors Payout Management"></a></p><p>Admins can now review pending payouts, filter and search by vendor or status, and run bulk Mark-as-Paid or CSV Export in one click — backed by six dedicated REST routes.</p><p>This also ships:</p><ul><li><strong>Category Filter</strong>: Inline product count and product search on the seller profile.</li><li><strong>Frontend Bulk Actions</strong>: Assign Categories and Publish actions directly on the seller product list.</li><li><strong>Data-Driven Seller-Profile Tabs</strong>: Optimized profile tabs for addons.</li></ul><hr><h2 id="vendors-payout-dashboard-features" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#vendors-payout-dashboard-features"><span>Vendors Payout Dashboard Features</span></a></h2><p>The new Vendors Payout Management dashboard provides a centralized view for admins to track vendor orders, commissions, payment methods, and seller payouts.</p><h3 id="dashboard-highlights" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#dashboard-highlights"><span>Dashboard Highlights</span></a></h3><ul><li><strong>Payable Withdrawals &amp; Unpaid Amounts</strong>: View total pending payable requests and total unpaid payout amounts at a glance.</li><li><strong>Total Commission Earned</strong>: Monitor total marketplace commission earnings.</li><li><strong>Unpaid Vendors</strong>: Track the number of vendors with unpaid payouts.</li></ul><h3 id="payout-management-capabilities" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#payout-management-capabilities"><span>Payout Management Capabilities</span></a></h3><ul><li><strong>Review Pending Payouts</strong>: Easily review all requested withdrawals from vendors.</li></ul><h4 id="filter-and-search" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#filter-and-search"><span>Filter and Search</span></a></h4><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/vendor-payout-filter.webp"><img src="'+i+'" alt="Vendor Payout Filters"></a></p><p>Admins can use the advanced filtering and searching tools to locate specific payout records quickly:</p><ul><li><strong>Filter by Vendor</strong>: Select a specific vendor from the dropdown (e.g., &quot;Blue Heaven&#39;s Store&quot; or &quot;ElectroMart&quot;) to view only their pending or completed payout requests.</li><li><strong>Filter by Status</strong>: View payouts by their current status, such as &quot;Pending&quot;, to isolate pending requests.</li><li><strong>Search by Withdrawal ID</strong>: Quickly find a specific withdrawal request by entering its unique ID in the search bar.</li></ul><h4 id="bulk-actions" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#bulk-actions"><span>Bulk Actions</span></a></h4><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/vendor-payout-bulk-actions.webp"><img src="'+o+'" alt="Vendor Payout Bulk Actions"></a></p><p>For efficient management of multiple withdrawal requests, admins can utilize the bulk actions menu:</p><ul><li><strong>Mark as Paid</strong>: Select multiple pending withdrawals using the checkboxes on the left, then run the &quot;Mark as Paid&quot; bulk action to clear them all in a single click.</li><li><strong>Export CSV</strong>: Download a comprehensive CSV file containing the selected payout records for offline accounting and external record-keeping.</li></ul><h4 id="individual-payouts" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#individual-payouts"><span>Individual Payouts</span></a></h4><ul><li><strong>Pay Now</strong>: Admins can also manage transactions individually by clicking the <strong>Pay Now</strong> button located next to any withdrawal request to quickly process a specific payout.</li></ul><hr>',23)])])}]]),d=JSON.parse('{"path":"/documentation/vendor-payout-management.html","title":"Vendors Payout Management","lang":"en-US","frontmatter":{},"headers":[{"level":2,"title":"Vendors Payout Dashboard Features","slug":"vendors-payout-dashboard-features","link":"#vendors-payout-dashboard-features","children":[{"level":3,"title":"Dashboard Highlights","slug":"dashboard-highlights","link":"#dashboard-highlights","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"Payout Management Capabilities","slug":"payout-management-capabilities","link":"#payout-management-capabilities","children":[]}]}],"git":{"contributors":[{"name":"nikhilsharma.qa322","username":"","email":"nikhilsharma.qa322@webkul.in","commits":1}],"changelog":[{"hash":"d1882b4ef1a32834cad22d704eaa526f47f8ab98","time":1782985531000,"email":"nikhilsharma.qa322@webkul.in","author":"nikhilsharma.qa322","message":"update the blog: add vendor payout section"}]},"filePathRelative":"documentation/vendor-payout-management.md"}')}}]);